        <mxCell id="Step8" value="Phase 8: Multi-Stage Containerization &amp; Cloud Ready&#xa;• Production-grade Dockerfile (dotnet/sdk:10.0 -&gt; dotnet/aspnet:10.0)&#xa;• Docker Compose multi-container orchestration (Web App + PostgreSQL)&#xa;• Built-in cloud DATABASE_URL parser for Render, Railway, Supabase, Neon" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
